.env
__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv

# Terraform (infra/terraform/) — downloaded provider plugins/local state,
# never committed. .terraform.lock.hcl (the provider *version* lock) is
# the opposite: that one IS meant to be committed, same spirit as a
# language lockfile, so it's deliberately not listed here.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
